In other words, every {{r|Treasure Room}} skipped will add 20% to the generation chance. However, if additional Treasure Rooms are entered, such as those created by {{i|Forget Me Now}} or {{i|Red Key}}, then the 20% penalty for entering a Treasure Room will be taken without receiving the 20% bonus for descending a floor.
* The combined percentage from descending floors and entering Treasure Rooms will never go below 0%.
* Entering Treasure Rooms in the [[Mirrored World]] of {{s|Downpour}} II / {{s|Dross}} II will not affect the generation chance.

